  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy & KVKK Text",
  "privacyPolicyPlaceholderBody": "1. Data Controller & Purpose:\nTürkiye Blood Network operates to connect voluntary blood donors with people in need.\n\n2. Special Category Personal Data:\nYour blood type, weight, and donation history are processed only with your explicit consent under KVKK Article 6 and are readable only by your account via Firestore security rules.\n\n3. Location & Contact Privacy:\nExact donor location is never stored or shared; only province and district are kept. Phone numbers are shared only after mutual 'I can help' confirmation.\n\n4. Data Subject Rights (Article 11):\nYou can export all your data as JSON or permanently delete your account from the Profile screen.",
  "termsOfUseTitle": "Terms of Use",
  "termsOfUsePlaceholderBody": "1. Voluntary Basis & Non-Commercial Rule:\nRequesting or offering blood for money or any material benefit is strictly prohibited.\n\n2. Kızılay & Official Institutions:\nThis app does not replace the Turkish Red Crescent (Kızılay) or Ministry of Health; it facilitates hospital-based voluntary donor routing.\n\n3. Medical Responsibility:\nFinal eligibility decisions belong to the authorized physician at the blood donation center.",
